==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*teh₂g-|id=touch}}
Borrowed from {{bor|en|fr|taximètre}}, from {{der|en|de|Taxameter}}, coined from {{der|en|ML.|taxa||tax, charge}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*teh₂g-||to touch, handle|id=touch}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|RP}} {{IPA|en|/ˈtaksɪˌmiːtə/|/ˈtaksiˌmiːtə/}}
* {{a|GA}} {{IPA|en|/ˈtæksiˌmitɚ/}}
* {{i|obsolete}} {{IPA|en|/tækˈsɪmɪtə(ɹ)/}}<ref>{{R:Oxford English Dictionary|Taximeter|IX|part=2|122|2}}</ref>

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A [[device]] installed in a [[taxicab]] that [[calculate]]s the [[fare]] based upon [[distance]] [[travel]]led and [[wait]]ing [[time]].

